{"seq":3,"slug":"misleading-charts","title":"误导性图表的常见陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/dashboard-system/chart-practice/misleading-charts","wordCount":3242,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"误导性图表的常见陷阱\">误导性图表的常见陷阱</h1><p>如果一个团队因为一张图而做出了错误的优化决策，这张图造成的损失可能超过一个月的工作量。误导性图表最危险的地方不在于它画错了数据——数据通常是对的——而在于它<strong>在正确的数据上引导出错误的结论</strong>。读者看到一条陡峭上升的曲线，得出结论&quot;延迟在暴涨&quot;，于是启动紧急优化；而实际上真实变化是 2%。这一节列出六类高频陷阱，每类给出&quot;什么时候是良性的、什么时候是误导的&quot;判据，以及应当改用的画法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-误导来自三个层面的失真\">核心概念：误导来自三个层面的失真</h2><p>图表误导可以归因到三个层面的失真，它们的修复方式不同。</p>\n<p><strong>坐标层面的失真</strong>：轴的范围、类型、起点。典型是截断的 Y 轴。<strong>视觉权重层面的失真</strong>：图形的面积、长度、颜色与它所代表的数值不成比例。典型是把一维的数值画成面积（二维）的图形。<strong>语境层面的失真</strong>：缺少参照、缺少样本量、缺少不确定性的表达。典型是只画一条曲线而不画基线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[图表误导] --&gt; B[坐标层面]&#10;    A --&gt; C[视觉权重层面]&#10;    A --&gt; D[语境层面]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[截断 Y 轴]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[双 Y 轴]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[线性轴画跨数量级数据]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[面积图视觉放大]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[彩虹配色制造虚假结构]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[3D 与阴影遮挡]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[无基线无参照]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[小样本画分位数]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[累计值掩盖瞬时变化]\">graph TD\n    A[图表误导] --&gt; B[坐标层面]\n    A --&gt; C[视觉权重层面]\n    A --&gt; D[语境层面]\n    B --&gt; B1[截断 Y 轴]\n    B --&gt; B2[双 Y 轴]\n    B --&gt; B3[线性轴画跨数量级数据]\n    C --&gt; C1[面积图视觉放大]\n    C --&gt; C2[彩虹配色制造虚假结构]\n    C --&gt; C3[3D 与阴影遮挡]\n    D --&gt; D1[无基线无参照]\n    D --&gt; D2[小样本画分位数]\n    D --&gt; D3[累计值掩盖瞬时变化]</pre><p>三个层面中，<strong>语境层面的失真危害最大</strong>，因为它不改变图形的视觉外观，读者没有视觉线索去发现它。截断的 Y 轴至少会让读者怀疑&quot;这图是不是放大了&quot;，而缺少样本量的极端分位数曲线看起来完全正常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱一-截断的-y-轴\">陷阱一：截断的 Y 轴</h2><p>从 0 开始还是不从 0 开始，这不是一个风格问题，而取决于<strong>读者会从图中得出什么结论</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>什么时候良性</strong>：当你展示的是一个<strong>围绕基线的小幅波动</strong>，且明确的意图是&quot;看波动形状&quot;。例如看板上的延迟曲线固定在 250-350ms 区间，从 0 开始的话所有变化都被压成一条直线。此时截断 Y 轴是有必要的，读者也确实需要看到形状。</p>\n<p><strong>什么时候误导</strong>：当读者可能把曲线的高度当作变化的幅度时。典型的失效场景：一条从 300 到 306ms 的曲线，Y 轴截断到 295-310，视觉上看起来像&quot;翻了一倍&quot;。任何看到这张图的非直接相关人员都可能得出&quot;性能严重劣化&quot;的结论。</p>\n<p><strong>判据</strong>：如果一张图可能被转发到不熟悉上下文的人手里（群聊、周报、事故复盘），Y 轴就必须从 0 开始，或者必须在图上明确标注轴的范围。反之，如果它固定只在团队内部的专业视图里使用，截断是可接受的。更稳妥的通用做法是<strong>同时给出两个版本</strong>：截断版（看形状）与从零版（看幅度）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱二-双-y-轴\">陷阱二：双 Y 轴</h2><p>双 Y 轴把两个量纲不同、数量级不同的指标画在同一张图上，各自用自己的刻度。它的危害是<strong>暗示一个不存在的相关性</strong>。</p>\n<p>具体机制是这样的：假设要把搜索 QPS 与 p99 延迟画在一起。QPS 在 80 万到 120 万之间，p99 在 280 到 340ms 之间。两个刻度各自拉伸到填满图高，于是两条曲线看起来紧密咬合、此起彼伏。读者会得出&quot;QPS 上升导致延迟上升&quot;的结论——而这可能完全是两个刻度选择的巧合。只要调整其中一个刻度，就能让两条曲线看起来同向、反向或无关。</p>\n<p><strong>什么时候良性</strong>：几乎不存在。双 Y 轴唯一勉强站得住的用法是两个指标之间存在确定的物理关系（例如&quot;输入量&quot;与&quot;输出量&quot;），且图的目的仅仅是让读者同时看到两者的时序。</p>\n<p><strong>正确替代</strong>：如果目的是看相关性，用<strong>散点图</strong>（X 轴一个指标、Y 轴另一个、点的时间顺序用颜色深浅表达），它能真实呈现相关性有无。如果目的是看时序对照，用<strong>堆叠的两个独立面板</strong>（共享 X 轴，各自 Y 轴），读者的眼睛不会被虚假的咬合误导。如果目的确实是把两个数放在一起（例如&quot;QPS&quot;和&quot;单机 QPS&quot;），用<strong>比值或归一化</strong>（把第二个指标除以第一个）画成单轴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱三-用面积表达一维数值\">陷阱三：用面积表达一维数值</h2><p>人眼对面积的感知是<strong>平方级</strong>的，对长度的感知是线性的。因此如果把一个数值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 画成半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的圆（面积正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），读者感知到的差异会被放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍。经典例子是气泡图：气泡半径按数值缩放，看起来 2 倍的数值对应 4 倍的视觉重量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>视觉误导系数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>面积比</mtext><mtext>数值比</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{视觉误导系数} = \\frac{\\text{面积比}}{\\text{数值比}} = \\frac{(v_2/v_1)^2}{v_2/v_1} = \\frac{v_2}{v_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">视觉误导系数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数值比</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">面积比</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4271em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果确实要用气泡表达数值，正确做法是<strong>让面积正比于数值</strong>，即半径正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>v</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这样视觉权重与数值一致，代价是小数值的气泡会小到难以点击——因此气泡图不适合数值跨度超过一个数量级的场景，此时应当改用条形图。</p>\n<p>条形图与此同理但更微妙：条形图中所有条形的宽度必须相同，只有长度变化。如果宽度也随数值变化（这在手绘或某些工具默认设置下会发生），长度与宽度会叠乘，产生平方级的失真。<strong>判据</strong>：任何用二维图形（面积、圆、矩形）表达一维数值的图，都必须确认面积的缩放是线性的，且宽度是常数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱四-彩虹配色制造虚假结构\">陷阱四：彩虹配色制造虚假结构</h2><p>用彩虹色阶（红-黄-绿-蓝-紫，即 HSV 色轮循环）画热图或连续变量，会造出数据里不存在的分界线。原因是彩虹色阶的<strong>感知亮度不是单调的</strong>：黄色最亮、蓝色最暗，因此色阶中会出现几个明显的亮暗转折。读者会在这些转折处看到&quot;分层&quot;或&quot;边界&quot;，而数据本身是连续平滑的。</p>\n<p>热图受这个陷阱的危害最大，因为热图的主要用途就是读结构。如果色阶在某个中间值处有一个亮点，热图会呈现出一条清晰的&quot;带&quot;，让人误以为那里存在一个真实的分界。</p>\n<p><strong>正确替代</strong>：使用感知均匀的、亮度单调的色阶。单色渐变（浅蓝到深蓝）、或科学可视化的成熟色阶（viridis、magma、cividis 一类，其设计目标就是感知亮度的单调性与色盲友好性）。这类色阶的共同点是：亮度单调递增，因此数值越大视觉越&quot;重&quot;，不会产生虚假的带。Grafana、Vega、matplotlib 等主流工具都内置了 viridis 系列色阶（来源：matplotlib 官方 colormaps 文档，viridis 于 matplotlib 2.0 起成为默认色阶）。</p>\n<p><strong>判据</strong>：如果一张热图里能看到明显的不连续&quot;边界&quot;，先怀疑色阶而不是数据。验证方式是换成单色渐变重画一次，如果边界消失，那就是色阶的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱五-无基线的孤立曲线\">陷阱五：无基线的孤立曲线</h2><p>一条没有参照的曲线几乎无法被判读，但它在视觉上完全&quot;正常&quot;，因此这个陷阱最难被发现。</p>\n<p>具体形态：看板上一条 p99 曲线从早到晚在 280-350ms 之间起伏，读者盯了三十秒后得出结论&quot;还行&quot;。但实际上正常水位是 200ms，今天整体高了 50%。因为曲线是<strong>平滑的</strong>、<strong>没有突变的</strong>，读者的大脑把&quot;平滑&quot;当成了&quot;正常&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>修复方式</strong>有三层，从弱到强：画一条固定阈值线（至少给一个绝对参照）；画基线带（过去 7 天同段的中位数与 p25-p75 区间）；画同比曲线（去年同期）。前两种的成本很低，应当在所有值班面板上强制；第三种用于高管视图。基线的计算细节见 <a href=\"comparison-slice\">同比环比与多维下钻</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>判据</strong>：面板上如果只有一条曲线而没有其他任何参照物，这个面板就必须被改造。可以问一个检验性问题：&quot;一个不知道昨天发生了什么的工程师，能不能从这张图上判断现在是否异常？&quot;如果不能，就需要加基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱六-小样本画分位数与累计值掩盖瞬时变化\">陷阱六：小样本画分位数与累计值掩盖瞬时变化</h2><p>这两个陷阱都属于&quot;数据正确但结论错误&quot;，放在一起因为它们经常同时出现。</p>\n<p><strong>小样本画分位数</strong>：p99.9 在每分钟几百请求的切片上只是噪声。它的危险之处在于<strong>噪声长得像事故</strong>：随机的稀疏样本会产生剧烈的尖刺，值班工程师会为此启动排查，最终一无所获。这类假告警会迅速消耗团队对告警系统的信任，因此图表侧应当主动承担一部分责任：把不可信的数值明确标出来，而不是让告警系统去过滤噪声。<strong>修复方式</strong>：在图上标注样本量，或者在样本量低于阈值时把该段曲线置灰而不是画出来。样本量的具体下限推导见 <a href=\"comparison-slice\">同比环比与多维下钻</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>累计值掩盖瞬时变化</strong>：累计计数器（例如&quot;累计错误数&quot;或 Prometheus 的 Counter 类型的原始值）在图上永远单调上升或持平。当错误停止增长时，累计曲线变成一条水平线——看起来&quot;很好&quot;，实则错误已经不再新增但历史错误仍在，也可能只是这一段时间没有流量。任何依赖累计值形状的判断都会失效，因为累计值的斜率才是速率。<strong>修复方式</strong>：永远画速率的导数（<code>rate()</code>、<code>increase()</code> 或差分），而不是累计值本身。Prometheus 的 <code>rate()</code> 函数正是为此存在（来源：Prometheus 官方文档 Query functions）。如果必须展示累计值（例如&quot;本月累计订单数&quot;用于业务汇报），则必须同时展示其斜率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>数据正确性</th>\n<th>视觉线索</th>\n<th>读者会得出的错误结论</th>\n<th>修复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>截断 Y 轴</td>\n<td>正确</td>\n<td>有（轴范围）</td>\n<td>小幅变化是剧烈变化</td>\n<td>从零重画或标出轴范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双 Y 轴</td>\n<td>正确</td>\n<td>弱（需注意刻度）</td>\n<td>两个指标存在相关性</td>\n<td>散点图或堆叠独立面板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面积表达一维</td>\n<td>正确</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>差异被平方放大</td>\n<td>面积正比数值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∝</mo><msqrt><mi>v</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\propto \\sqrt{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>彩虹配色</td>\n<td>正确</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>数据存在不存在的分界</td>\n<td>感知均匀的亮度单调色阶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无基线</td>\n<td>正确</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>平滑即是正常</td>\n<td>加阈值线或基线带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小样本分位数</td>\n<td>正确</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>噪声是事故</td>\n<td>标注样本量或置灰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累计值</td>\n<td>正确</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>水平意味着健康</td>\n<td>画速率而非累计值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的关键信息是&quot;视觉线索&quot;一列：五个陷阱中有三个<strong>完全没有任何视觉线索</strong>提示读者图形有问题。这就是为什么图表规范不能靠读者的直觉来兜底，而必须由看板的<strong>建造者</strong>在构建时就强制执行——这与 <a href=\"../dashboard-ops/dashboard-lifecycle\">看板评审、下线与所有权</a> 中&quot;评审检查项&quot;的定位一致：把这类判断变成流程，而不是依赖个体素养。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>误导分为三个层面：坐标（截断轴、双轴、轴类型）、视觉权重（面积、配色）、语境（无基线、小样本、累计值）；语境层面危害最大因为无视觉线索。</li>\n<li>截断 Y 轴在&quot;看小幅波动形状&quot;时良性、在&quot;读者可能把高度当幅度&quot;时误导；转发场景必须从零开始或标注轴范围。</li>\n<li>双 Y 轴几乎总是暗示不存在的相关性（刻度可任意调）；替代方案是散点图、堆叠独立面板或归一化后的单轴。</li>\n<li>用面积表达一维数值会把差异按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_2/v_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍放大；必须让面积正比于数值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∝</mo><msqrt><mi>v</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\propto \\sqrt{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），条形图必须等宽。</li>\n<li>彩虹色阶的感知亮度非单调，会在热图上造出虚假分界；改用亮度单调、感知均匀的色阶（viridis 一类）。</li>\n<li>无基线的平滑曲线最容易被误判为正常；值班面板必须强制带阈值线或基线带。</li>\n<li>小样本分位数长得像事故（消耗告警信任）；累计值掩盖瞬时变化，必须画速率而非累计值。</li>\n<li>五个陷阱中三个没有视觉线索，因此必须由看板建造者在构建时强制，并纳入评审检查项。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"误导性图表的常见陷阱","id":"误导性图表的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：误导来自三个层面的失真","id":"核心概念-误导来自三个层面的失真"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱一：截断的 Y 轴","id":"陷阱一-截断的-y-轴"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱二：双 Y 轴","id":"陷阱二-双-y-轴"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱三：用面积表达一维数值","id":"陷阱三-用面积表达一维数值"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱四：彩虹配色制造虚假结构","id":"陷阱四-彩虹配色制造虚假结构"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱五：无基线的孤立曲线","id":"陷阱五-无基线的孤立曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱六：小样本画分位数与累计值掩盖瞬时变化","id":"陷阱六-小样本画分位数与累计值掩盖瞬时变化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同比环比与多维下钻","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/dashboard-system/chart-practice/comparison-slice"},"next":{"title":"看板评审、下线与所有权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/dashboard-system/dashboard-ops/dashboard-lifecycle"}}